WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:10.910
[snaps]
First things first.

00:00:10.943 --> 00:00:12.879 align:start size:78% position:22%
I do not care that you're

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:15.381 align:end position:100%
a multi-platinum selling
rapper, Gun Rack.

00:00:15.414 --> 00:00:17.950 align:end position:100%
What I care about
is that I, 100%,

00:00:17.983 --> 00:00:20.086 align:end position:100%
know that you murdered
Darnell Simmons.

00:00:20.119 --> 00:00:22.221 align:end position:100%
So,
you better start talking.

00:00:22.254 --> 00:00:25.258
[dramatic music]

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:28.561
♪ ♪

00:00:28.594 --> 00:00:31.230 align:start position:0%
[softly] Yeah,
but you ain't got nothing.

00:00:31.263 --> 00:00:33.633 align:start size:53% position:47%
Oh. Uh, you know,

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:36.235 align:end position:100%
I'm actually, I'm very glad
that you said that.

00:00:36.268 --> 00:00:40.907 align:end position:100%
Because I--respectfully,
I beg to differ.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.542
[hip hop music
on tape player]

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:45.611
♪ I killed Darnell, yeah,
I shot him with my nine ♪

00:00:45.644 --> 00:00:49.282
♪ I shot him nine times,
9:00 p.m. on the dime ♪

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:51.884
♪ And by the way,
it was November 9th ♪

00:00:51.917 --> 00:00:52.919
[music stops]

00:00:58.991 --> 00:01:01.027 size:75% position:38%
That don't mean nothing.

00:01:02.761 --> 00:01:05.765 size:81% position:41%
I got a vivid imagination.

00:01:05.798 --> 00:01:09.402 align:start position:0%
I couldn't have shot
Darnell.

00:01:09.435 --> 00:01:12.839 align:start position:0%
I was at my cousin's
birthday party.

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:15.842 size:81% position:41%
Red Lobster, November 9th.

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.977
- At Red Lobster?
- Mm hmm.

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:19.278 align:end position:100%
Geez, I got to tell you,
Gun Rack,

00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:22.915 align:end position:100%
I find that really hard
to believe.

00:01:22.948 --> 00:01:24.817
[music continues]
- ♪ I got an alibi ♪

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.419
♪ Birthday,
Red Lobster ♪

00:01:26.452 --> 00:01:30.623
♪ When in reality I shot
Darnell like a mobster ♪

00:01:30.656 --> 00:01:33.326
♪ It's a lie,
Anyone could tell this ♪

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:35.695
♪ Because I got an allergy
to all shellfish ♪

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:37.864
[music stops]

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:39.599 align:start size:72% position:28%
Just confess, Gun Rack.

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:42.835 align:start position:0%
I confess that "shellfish"
is the only thing

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:46.139
that rhymes with "tell this".

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:50.776 size:84% position:42%
It's just words, Detective.

00:01:50.809 --> 00:01:53.179 align:start position:0%
Nouns, adjectives.

00:01:53.212 --> 00:01:56.282 align:start position:0%
That just happen to be
in a dope order.

00:01:56.315 --> 00:02:01.220
But...you ain't got no proof.

00:02:01.253 --> 00:02:03.189
[music continues]
- ♪ Shot up Darnell ♪

00:02:03.222 --> 00:02:04.690
♪ With a long-ass gun ♪

00:02:04.723 --> 00:02:07.627
♪ And I tossed it
into the aquarium ♪

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:10.163
♪ ♪

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:12.732 align:start position:0%
I have no idea
what that object is.

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:15.701
- I don't--
- If I had to identify it,

00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:20.540 align:start position:0%
I would call it a gun
of the long-ass variety.

00:02:20.573 --> 00:02:24.310 align:start position:0%
Some seaweed in there, too.
Look, Detective.

00:02:24.343 --> 00:02:26.212 size:81% position:41%
I hate to break it to you.

00:02:26.245 --> 00:02:28.915 align:start position:0%
I ain't kill nobody.

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:30.583
[music continues]

00:02:30.616 --> 00:02:33.719
♪ I stroke my chin real slow
when I'm lying ♪

00:02:33.752 --> 00:02:36.489
♪ And I was laughing super hard
as Darnell was dying ♪

00:02:36.522 --> 00:02:41.561 align:end position:100%
The name of the album
is<i> I Killed Darnell Simmons.</i>

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:43.429
- It's a concept album.
- A concept--

00:02:43.462 --> 00:02:45.164 align:start size:75% position:25%
That's a picture of you.

00:02:45.197 --> 00:02:49.802 align:end position:100%
A picture of you, and behind you
is Darnell Simmons's body!

00:02:53.272 --> 00:02:54.707 align:start size:88% position:13%
Coincidence.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.776 align:end position:100%
You're going away
for a long time, you understand?

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:59.278 size:88% position:56%
You're gonna confess if it's
the last thing you ever do,

00:02:59.311 --> 00:03:00.913
you hear me, Gun Rack?
I'll beat it out of you.

00:03:00.946 --> 00:03:01.747
- Joe.
- I'll beat it out of you.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:02.715
Joe!

00:03:07.753 --> 00:03:09.255 align:start position:0%
He's free to go.

00:03:09.288 --> 00:03:10.723 align:end position:100%
What?
No. No, no, no, no, no.

00:03:10.756 --> 00:03:12.191 align:end position:100%
We have everything
we need.

00:03:12.224 --> 00:03:13.526
No, it was Simmons's
girlfriend.

00:03:13.559 --> 00:03:15.094
She just confessed
to the whole thing.

00:03:15.127 --> 00:03:18.931
Infidelity.
Crime of passion.

00:03:18.964 --> 00:03:20.132
Let's go, Mr. Rack.

00:03:20.165 --> 00:03:23.135
[dramatic music]

00:03:23.168 --> 00:03:31.110
♪ ♪

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:37.316
[music from tape player]
- Bonus track, bonus track.

00:03:37.349 --> 00:03:38.985
♪ Got a ride or die bitch ♪

00:03:39.018 --> 00:03:41.087
♪ I think you get the gist ♪

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:44.323
♪ And when you let me out,
I'm gonna blow a little kiss ♪

00:03:44.356 --> 00:03:47.260
♪ Consider this my confession
admissible in a court ♪

00:03:47.293 --> 00:03:49.629
♪ I killed Darnell Simmons
for sport ♪

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:52.398
[laughs]
♪ That's right, I'm a murderer ♪

00:03:52.431 --> 00:03:53.833
- ♪ Come and get me ♪
- Hector, stop!

00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:56.435
♪ You can't,
come down the hall and get me ♪

00:03:56.468 --> 00:03:57.436
♪ Okay, okay,
you got me ♪

00:03:57.469 --> 00:03:58.738
You got me, you got me.

00:03:58.771 --> 00:04:00.506
Yes. Whoa, whoa. Damn.
Ow, ow!

